## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` to ensure there are no compilation issues across imports and split components.
- Run `npm run lint` to ensure zero syntax or standard linter issues.

### Manual Verification
- Navigate through all pages (Dashboard, Statement, Inventory, VIP, Account, Deposit, Investments) on the development server to verify they load and operate identically.
